meta {
  name: Get My Profile
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/user/my_profile
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get My Profile

  This request is used to get user profile info. This request interacts with the MySQL database, and have a protected routes.

  ## Responses

  **200 — user fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "user fetched",
    "data": {
      "id": "17963858-9771-11ee-8f4a-3216422910r4",
      "username": "flazefy",
      "email": "flazen.edu@gmail.com",
      "role": "user",
      "telegram_user_id": "1317625970",
      "telegram_is_valid": 1,
      "created_at": "2024-09-20 22:53:47"
    },
    "telegram_data": {
      "id": "6f59235e-c398-8a83-2f95-3f1fbe95ca6e",
      "request_type": "register",
      "request_context": "OUW36L",
      "created_at": "2024-09-20 22:53:47"
    }
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **404 — user failed to fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "user not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}